Enable pinctrl for phyCARD-S devices.

Signed-off-by: Markus Pargmann <mpa-bIcnvbaLZ9MEGnE8C9+IrQ@public.gmane.org>
Acked-by: Sascha Hauer <s.hauer-bIcnvbaLZ9MEGnE8C9+IrQ@public.gmane.org>
